      "value": "There seems to be a maximum distance that the menu can be accessed from. On giant avatars, the user's head is very far from the menu. \nUser workaround: lean in close to the menu to be able to press buttons in the menu\nDeveloper fix: look for any required raycasts for a maximum value, look for any distance to camera checks",
